Z||000000||Syrin||12-07-2001||05:12 PM||||I have a few questions, how much H.P. does a 86 fiero GT have with the 2.8V6?<P>Can it beat honda CRX's and civics?<P>Is it a fair trade for an 84 camaro berlinetta with a 350?<P>heres whats up, a guy wants to trade me his fiero formy camaro, now i like the GT fiero but i dont want a car that will be pumping money out of me, cus i dont have that much money at the moment and i need a car that will have better gas mileage than my camaro but still good looking and sporty, he says the transmission is a 5 speed but it has a problem, it slips outta 3rd sometimes cus i guess he put it in wrong,also he says he put in an new engine block too...anyway are these fairly reliable?<P>One more question, would an 86 fiero gt (2.8 V6) beat an 88 prelude si (2.0 4cyl. DOHC) stock for stock race?||||reg||14
