Z||000005||JohnF||12-07-2001||06:14 PM||||Just a word to the wise - you have questions that should be posted in CHAT, that's what it is for.  Your questions have a many possible answers and for the most part are just a matter of personal preference.  <P>If you like the Camaro, get it!<P>If you like the Fiero, stay with it!<P>If you want something else in the mid-eighties or so, get that!<P>Remember, ALL older pieces of equipment have problems.  Either live with them or get a new one.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1578096&a=12001112&p=56509969&Sequence=0"> ||||reg||7
